    "detailed_description": "Play the role of an apprentice alchemist on the road in a merchant caravan. During the journey you will discover many things, including love?<br><br>The Alchemist is a <strong>gay medieval fantasy visual novel</strong>. You play as an apprentice alchemist on a journey in a merchant caravan. There, you will meet colorful characters, discover their way of seeing the world and maybe experience an intense romance... The Alchemist is a story focused game with meaningful choices. You will get caught in the middle of hostilities between two neighboring kingdoms. The choices you make will influence the outcome of the conflict as well as your future.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br>Wordcount - 65K~ in the full game, 4.5K~ in the demo<br><br>Estimated duration - 2h30-3h/route, 9h for the overall in the full game, 25min for the demo<br><br>Endings - 15 love endings, 6 professions ending, 3 world events endings<br><br>CGs /illustrations - 18<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">They talk about the game:</h2><br>Qweerty (01/14/2023) : &quot;Now that we think of it, it\u2019s a bit like cruising at a very gay Renaissance fair.&quot;<br><br>Qweek (N\u00b0108 03/2022) : &quot;In short, this is a game we recommend!&quot; (Translated from French)<br><br>T\u00eatu (02/25/2022) : &quot;A concept that caught T\u00eatu's curiosity.&quot; (Translated from French)",
